<title>SOUTH AFRICA: UMBONO HALF-YEAR ATTRIB 1.65 MLN RAND.</title>
<headline>UMBONO HALF-YEAR ATTRIB 1.65 MLN RAND.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended June 30</p>
<p>versus forecast per pre-listing statement for year ended Dec 31,</p>
<p>1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)	 </p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     31.71	 (vs   10.99)</p>
<p>    Attrib income	    1.65	 (vs    0.97)</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		    2.54	 (vs    1.62)</p>
<p>    Tax			  0.89	 (vs    0.65)</p>
<p>    Interest income	  4.25	 (vs    5.94)</p>
<p>    Expenses		   1.72	 (vs    4.32)</p>
<p>Full name: Umbono Investment Corp Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Umbono, which invests in unlisted and closely-held</p>
<p>listed firms, said it was close to concluding transactions</p>
<p>totalling some 20 million rand. The private equity fund listed</p>
<p>last December.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
